<title>UK: Goldman Sachs sets warrants on MIB-30 index.</title>
<headline>Goldman Sachs sets warrants on MIB-30 index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs International said it has issued six million American-style call warrants, in three equal tranches, on the MIB-30 index.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	20.MAR.98		 PAYDATE	31.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG		MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  18400</p>
<p>* * * * * * *</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRIKE     ISSUE	 PREMIUM	GEARING</p>
<p> CALL A     18000	2496 ITL    11.4 PCT     7.37 X</p>
<p> CALL B     20000	1490 ITL    16.8 PCT     12.35 X</p>
<p> CALL C     22000	786 ITL     23.8 PCT     23.4 X</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
